@title 3D vents: the proposal card with a grille already in the cabinet adds only the fan
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# On the hot cabinet a grille of the default size is added by hand first. It is big enough for the proposed filter fan, so the card says nothing about a grille and its button adds the fan alone. The run started by adding it is finished before the shot, so the card is idle.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 45
expect "Cooling selection proposes"
shot 01-before-grille
click_text "Add opening"
wait 10
click_text "Grille, high on the right wall"
wait 20
wait_s 200
expect_not "Locked while the run goes"
expect "Grille, in the right wall"
expect "Cooling selection proposes"
expect_not "smaller than this flow needs"
expect_not "A grille of about"
shot 02-grille-then-card
check_layout
check_blank 02-grille-then-card
